        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Outline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, a mechanic, have picked up three robots from a scrapyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a dimly lit garage, you charge and revive the robots.  After that, you can peek into their memories through dialogue.  Or you can enjoy the robots' reactions by applying high voltage to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, their batteries only have a short lifespan left.   How they spend the rest of their lives is in your hands...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Robots </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/ffcc4a8e963ce0c89aae974a38a557d0.poster.avif?t=1776305721\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/ffcc4a8e963ce0c89aae974a38a557d0.webm?t=1776305721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/ffcc4a8e963ce0c89aae974a38a557d0.mp4?t=1776305721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;J.S.C.A&quot;</strong> : a robot waitress at the diner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/b36eacd2fd958484781d2f2709a08303.poster.avif?t=1776305721\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/b36eacd2fd958484781d2f2709a08303.webm?t=1776305721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/b36eacd2fd958484781d2f2709a08303.mp4?t=1776305721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;Surverry&quot;</strong> : a security robot for monitoring offices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/b699a2a1f5d8b0f1facd5202b2e275ac.poster.avif?t=1776305721\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/b699a2a1f5d8b0f1facd5202b2e275ac.webm?t=1776305721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/b699a2a1f5d8b0f1facd5202b2e275ac.mp4?t=1776305721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;Devind R7&quot;</strong> : a combat robot that seems to have been developed for military use. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME DESIGN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an adventure game.  You can select one of three robots and charge and converse with them within a time limit. <br><br>How you treat them will change their reactions,  and the ending of the game will change little by little along with their fate.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, the owner of the electrical outlet and the high-voltage switch, have the power to make your robots happy or unhappy.  <br><br>You can play with the same robot over and over again. You can aim to unlock all ending achievements, or you can just try to make the robots happy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No difficult controls — anyone can reach the ending. Designed to make your <i>first</i> playthrough truly special.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic 4-color pixel art reminiscent of 90's portable game consoles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy various conversations with attractive robot characters </p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Outline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, a mechanic, have picked up three robots from a scrapyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a dimly lit garage, you charge and revive the robots.  After that, you can peek into their memories through dialogue.  Or you can enjoy the robots' reactions by applying high voltage to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, their batteries only have a short lifespan left.   How they spend the rest of their lives is in your hands...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Robots </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/ffcc4a8e963ce0c89aae974a38a557d0.poster.avif?t=1776305721\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/ffcc4a8e963ce0c89aae974a38a557d0.webm?t=1776305721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/ffcc4a8e963ce0c89aae974a38a557d0.mp4?t=1776305721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;J.S.C.A&quot;</strong> : a robot waitress at the diner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/b36eacd2fd958484781d2f2709a08303.poster.avif?t=1776305721\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/b36eacd2fd958484781d2f2709a08303.webm?t=1776305721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/b36eacd2fd958484781d2f2709a08303.mp4?t=1776305721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;Surverry&quot;</strong> : a security robot for monitoring offices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/b699a2a1f5d8b0f1facd5202b2e275ac.poster.avif?t=1776305721\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/b699a2a1f5d8b0f1facd5202b2e275ac.webm?t=1776305721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/b699a2a1f5d8b0f1facd5202b2e275ac.mp4?t=1776305721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;Devind R7&quot;</strong> : a combat robot that seems to have been developed for military use. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME DESIGN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an adventure game.  You can select one of three robots and charge and converse with them within a time limit. <br><br>How you treat them will change their reactions,  and the ending of the game will change little by little along with their fate.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, the owner of the electrical outlet and the high-voltage switch, have the power to make your robots happy or unhappy.  <br><br>You can play with the same robot over and over again. You can aim to unlock all ending achievements, or you can just try to make the robots happy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No difficult controls — anyone can reach the ending. Designed to make your <i>first</i> playthrough truly special.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic 4-color pixel art reminiscent of 90's portable game consoles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy various conversations with attractive robot characters </p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "BatteryNote is a multi-ending sci-fi adventure visual novel game. You can recharge three robots with limited lifespans, bringing them back to life. Interact with them through conversations or experiment by applying high voltage. How they spend their final moments is entirely up to you.",
